
# PENDING — this section is deliberately empty.
#
# Depends on a fully built ctx (spec + point + options) that the
# shared runner cannot assemble from a literal; covered by makeSpec/makeUrl
# upstream and by the per-language pipeline suites.
#
# An empty `set` runs ZERO cases. Runners must not treat that as a pass by
# accident: test/parity.test.ts in @voxgig/sdkgen asserts that every empty
# fixture carries this PENDING marker, so an accidentally-blanked fixture
# fails the build while a knowingly-deferred one does not.

basic: set: []
